  "research": "Find mail from the HPL schedulers (Lloyd, Lannou, Farmer) showing what they do with the Calpine .doc, such as typing it into a nomination system, replying to confirm, or fixing errors. Also check whether Calpine would agree to a new format and how many nominations a month actually arrive."
