  "change": "Generate the report automatically from Global Contracts on a schedule and let recipients subscribe themselves, instead of Cheryl Dudley compiling it and keeping the distribution list by hand.",
  "reason": "The mail shows a monthly report (titled 03/01 and 04/01), not two a month: the 8 March issue was a one-time catch-up for a missed March report, and 2133.eml is the same 23 March message as 211.eml. Nothing in the mail shows that the report is put together by hand rather than printed from Global, and no add or remove requests for the list appear, so the time saved per report has no support.",
